  - {fileID: 617708236899014977, guid: 2041ca8289a170647a7513a050a848ff, type: 3}
  paragraphs:
  - 'SKIPPY: You been enjoying those upgrades Cosmo?'
  - "COSMO: Yes, they\u2019ve been very helpful. "
  - 'COSMO: Though I was wondering how you can directly alter the properties of my
    ship so far away from the base. '
  - "SKIPPY: I was actually gonna ask you the same thing, must be some more of that
    strange \u201CSpecimen X\u201D technology that\u2019s embedded throughout your
    whole ship."
  - "COSMO: How interesting... Keep up the good work Skippy, more upgrades like that
    and we\u2019ll be rid of them in no time."
  - "SKIPPY: Y\u2019know I was starting to think maybe all of them aliens ain\u2019t
    so bad after all if they\u2019ve got useful technology like this, but I\u2019ll
    keep at it."
